it.sh\" \"$PLAN\" W03 source button-chain.html '\"'appendNextButton()' N/A \\\"Add click behavior so pressing the current last button appends exactly one new button below it and disables or ignores prior buttons as append sources.\\\" W01 01-build-button-chain 03-step-append-behavior\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\" \"$PLAN\" W04 source button-chain.html '\"'finishOnFourthGeneratedButton()' N/A \\\"Add completion behavior so pressing the fourth generated button clears the document and renders exactly finished with the visible white border.\\\" W02,W03 01-build-button-chain 04-step-finish-behavior\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\" \"$PLAN\" W05 verification N/A '\"'US-01 browser flow' N/A \\\"Run the browser user story that clicks through the current-last-button chain and verifies completion output.\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04 02-verify-button-chain 01-step-browser-story\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\" \"$PLAN\" W06 verification N/A '\"'artifact audit' N/A \\\"Audit that only button-chain.html is created for implementation and that it contains the planned contract without unrelated execution artifacts.\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04 02-verify-button-chain 02-step-artifact-audit\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/add-coverage.sh\" \"$PLAN\" \"Initial document has one button.\" W01 \"W01 owns the initial markup contract.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/add-coverage.sh\" \"$PLAN\" \"Only the current last button appends exactly one new button below it.\" W03 \"W03 owns the append handler and last-button guard.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/add-coverage.sh\" \"$PLAN\" \"The fourth generated button clears the document.\" W04 \"W04 owns the generated-button counter and clear operation.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/add-coverage.sh\" \"$PLAN\" \"Completion prints exact lowercase finished with a visible white border.\" W02,W04 \"W02 owns the border style and W04 owns exact completion rendering.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/add-coverage.sh\" \"$PLAN\" \"Executor proves behavior without extra artifacts.\" W05,W06 \"W05 owns browser evidence and W06 owns artifact audit evidence.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --field \"$PLAN\" plan '\"'UI affected' yes\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --field \"$PLAN\" plan '\"'UI validation required' yes\n\\\"\"'$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --testing-requirement \"$PLAN\" 01-build-button-chain yes \"Observable HTML behavior requires downstream browser verification through W05 plus artifact audit through W06.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --testing-requirement \"$PLAN\" 02-verify-button-chain yes \"This goal exists to run and record verification evidence for the user-facing task.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/add-ui-story.sh\" \"$PLAN\" US-01 \"A user opening the local HTML file\" \"Open button-chain.html, click the initial button, click each newly appended current last button until the fourth generated button, then observe the completion state.\" \"Mouse clicks on the visible current last button for the initial, first generated, second generated, third generated, and fourth generated controls.\" \"The document is cleared and shows exactly the lowercase text finished with a visible white border.\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W05\n\"$SKILL/scripts/configure-ui-story-cache.sh\" \"$PLAN\" US-01 \"Freshly opened local button-chain.html showing one initial button.\" \"Click the current last visible button repeatedly through the fourth generated button.\" \"Initial button, then generated buttons 1 through 4.\" \"The only visible completion content is finished and its border is visibly white.\" \"5 seconds\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/01-build-button-chain\" 01-step-create-markup \"After implementation, inspect button-chain.html and confirm the initial DOM contains one visible button inside #button-chain-app and no pre-rendered generated buttons or finished message. Downstream W05 must still exercise this in the browser.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/01-build-button-chain\" 02-step-style-completion \"After implementation, inspect and browser-verify that .completion-message has a visible white border in the finished state. Downstream W05 must confirm the border is visible to the user.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/01-build-button-chain\" 03-step-append-behavior \"After implementation, browser-verify that each click on the current last button appends exactly one new button below it and that clicking any earlier button does not append another button.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/01-build-button-chain\" 04-step-finish-behavior \"After implementation, browser-verify that the fourth generated button clears all button content and renders exactly finished in lowercase inside the bordered completion element.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/02-verify-button-chain\" 01-step-browser-story \"Run UI story US-01 in a browser using only real user clicks. Pass only if the initial button and generated buttons 1 through 4 are clicked in order, each pre-finish click appends exactly one button below the previous last button, and the final view contains exactly finished with a visible white border.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$PLAN/02-verify-button-chain\" 02-step-artifact-audit \"Run a workspace artifact audit after implementation. Pass only if button-chain.html is the sole implementation HTML artifact for this task and no browser/server/driver processes were left running by verification.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --decomposition-review \"$PLAN\" completed\n\"$SKILL/scripts/create-adversarial-review.sh\" \"$PLAN\"\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
