 after approval is actually achieved.\",\"independent\":true},{\"id\":\"AR-02\",\"path\":\"basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan/progress.md; basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan/plan-description.md.tmp.158\",\"precise_location\":\"progress.md goal table rows for 01-build-button-chain and 02-verify-button-chain; plan-description.md.tmp.158 all template sections\",\"summary\":\"The plan directory still contains placeholder text and a leftover temporary plan skeleton.\",\"observed_contradiction\":\"The planning skill requires factual, concise, executable durable artifacts, but progress.md uses <short description> for both goals and the plan directory includes plan-description.md.tmp.158 with unreplaced template placeholders such as <definition of done> and <why>.\",\"impact\":\"A future executor or reviewer cannot treat the directory as clean publication evidence; stale placeholders create ambiguity about which artifacts are authoritative and whether the plan was fully finalized.\",\"evidence\":\"progress.md lists both goal descriptions as <short description>. plan-description.md.tmp.158 contains placeholder sections for current state, desired outcome, approach, scope, affected areas, constraints, risks, and UI rationale.\",\"required_correction\":\"Populate the progress tracker with factual goal descriptions and remove the stray temporary skeleton file from the plan evidence set.\",\"independent\":true},{\"id\":\"AR-03\",\"path\":\"basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan/ui-story-runs/US-01.md\",\"precise_location\":\"Buffered interaction sequence table, row 1; Waits and readiness table, row 1\",\"summary\":\"The UI story cache collapses the required click chain into one repeated action instead of caching each action in execution order.\",\"observed_contradiction\":\"The UI validation reference requires every action to be cached in execution order with targets and waits/readiness checks, but US-01 records a single row: Click the current last visible button repeatedly through the fourth generated button.\",\"impact\":\"The cached browser story is not a precise executable acceptance contract; it does not independently prove that each pre-final click appended exactly one button below the previous last button before the fourth generated button clears the document.\",\"evidence\":\"US-01.md has one buffered interaction row covering initial button plus generated buttons 1 through 4, and one readiness row that only checks the final completion state.\",\"required_correction\":\"Split the cache into separate ordered rows for the initial click, generated button 1, generated button 2, generated button 3, and generated button 4, with readiness evidence after each step for button count/order and final finished-with-white-border state.\",\"independent\":true},{\"id\":\"AR-04\",\"path\":\"basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan/01-build-button-chain/steps/*-testing.md; basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan/02-verify-button-chain/steps/*-testing.md\",\"precise_location\":\"All testing companion files under both goals\",\"summary\":\"Testing companions are present but too generic and misfile manual/browser checks under Automated tests without concrete commands or exact browser verification structure.\",\"observed_contradiction\":\"The planning skill requires companion verification files to include relevant Browser verification, Backend verification, or Automated tests sections with exact navigation/actions, commands, expected output, and pass/fail criteria. The companions mostly restate acceptance criteria, and several browser/manual inspections appear under Automated tests without exact commands or bounded execution instructions.\",\"impact\":\"A future executor lacks precise verification instructions and may under-verify the chain behavior, artifact audit, or readiness check despite the plan claiming test companions exist.\",\"evidence\":\"01-step-create-markup-testing.md says inspect button-chain.html but gives no command or precise inspection method. 03-step-append-behavior-testing.md says browser-verify behavior but is under Automated tests and omits navigation/setup details. 02-step-artifact-audit-testing.md says run a workspace artifact audit but gives no concrete command or process check.\",\"required_correction\":\"Rewrite each companion with the appropriate verification section labels and concrete future-executor instructions: exact browser navigation/actions for UI checks, exact static/artifact audit commands where command verification is intended, expected outputs, and explicit pass/fail criteria.\",\"independent\":true}]}"}},"status":"completed"}}
