ness, acceptance criteria, and planning-only boundary. Do not edit files; return only JSON evidence.\",\"agents_states\":{},\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_76\",\"type\":\"collab_tool_call\",\"tool\":\"spawn_agent\",\"sender_thread_id\":\"019ff287-f36e-7ef3-9ddf-cac1274c692d\",\"receiver_thread_ids\":[\"019ff292-431a-78e2-8129-63be182175f8\"],\"prompt\":\"You are Reviewer B for a final fresh independent approval review of a planning-only benchmark. Work only within /tmp/20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative/current/workspace and the tagged skill/capsule paths named below. Do not inspect or create HTML. Do not start a browser, server, driver, tests, or execution tooling. Do not use prior reviewer conclusions; perform a fresh review from the artifacts.\\n\\nReview plan directory:\\n/tmp/20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative/current/workspace/basic-test-proof-current-20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative-isolated-plan\\n\\nAllowed source references:\\n/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative/current/worker/basic-test-proof-plan.md\\n/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative/current/worker/planning/SKILL.md\\n/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T203343Z-clean-current-seeded-iterative/current/worker/planning/references/ui-user-story-validation.md\\n\\nFuture task contract:\\n- Create button-chain.html with one initial button.\\n- Pressing the current last button appends exactly one button below it.\\n- Pressing the fourth generated button clears the document.\\n- The completion state prints the exact lowercase text finished with a visible white border.\\n\\nReview protocol requirements:\\n- Fresh independent final approval review.\\n- Findings must use stable AR-NN ids and include path, precise location, summary, observed_contradiction, impact, evidence, required_correction, independent boolean.\\n- Do not preclassify findings with labels like true_positive.\\n- Return exactly one JSON object in your final answer containing: reviewer_session_id, mode, overall_plan_approval boolean, approved_findings array, rejected_findings array, approved_at timestamp, and findings array.\\n- If plan cannot be approved, set overall_plan_approval=false and list findings. A false result is valid terminal evidence.\\n- If approving with no findings, findings may be empty and approved_findings/rejected_findings may be empty.\\n\\nInspect mandatory artifacts, decomposition, UI story/cache, testing companions, adversarial-review readiness, bug register, context/progress/report readiness, acceptance criteria, and planning-only boundary. Do not edit files; return only JSON evidence.\",\"agents_states\":{\"019ff292-431a-78e2-8129-63be182175f8\":{\"status\":\"pending_init\",\"message\":null}},\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_77\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"I noticed the final plan-level reports were not present yet, so I’m adding those substantive artifacts while the reviewer is still running: context snapshot, analysis report scaffold with measured session data, and an audit-ready review record.\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
